    "summary": "Apply charge modifiers before checking whether targets fit the maximum distance. If a later modifier moves a chosen target beyond the limit, pick new ones. A roll of 7 with a +1 bonus reaches 8 inches. A roll of 9 after taking to the skies reaches 7 inches after the 2-inch reduction.",
